s2n-tls
------------------------------------------
s2n-tls is a C99 implementation of the TLS/SSL protocols that is designed to be
simple, small, fast, and with security as a priority.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libs2n-devel-1.7.14-1bl1
  libs2n1-1.7.14-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/aws/s2n-tls

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/aws/s2n-tls.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack s2n-tls-1.7.14-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./s2n-tls-1.7.14-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/s2n-tls-1.7.14-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/s2n-tls-1.7.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libs2n1-1.7.14-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libs2n-devel-1.7.14-X.tar.xz

